/T (TextRP is a communication platform designed to revolutionize the way users engage in messaging and digital interactions by integrating blockchain technology. Built on the XRP Ledger \(XRPL\), TextRP offers users secure, fast, and scalable messaging services that can operate across multiple networks and platforms.)
/E (TextRP is a communication platform designed to revolutionize the way users engage in messaging and digital interactions by integrating blockchain technology. Built on the XRP Ledger \(XRPL\), TextRP offers users secure, fast, and scalable messaging services that can operate across multiple networks and platforms.)
